# Corpus directories/patterns excluded from tools/full_render.py.
# One gitignore-style pattern per line -- see tools/full_render.py's own
# docstring for the exact (subset) syntax.

# Character models composite their skin/hair/face textures at runtime
# from CharComponentTextureLayoutsID/ItemDisplayInfo DB2 data -- there is
# no standalone texture file for husk to embed, structurally, regardless
# of what's on disk. Confirmed against all 144 real character/*.m2 files
# in the corpus (2026-08-15/16 investigation, CLAUDE_HISTORY.md).
character/
